# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solving valuable problems with quantum technology {#solving-valuable-problems-with-quantum-technology}"
msgstr "Paglutas ng mahahalagang problema gamit ang quantum technology {#solving-valuable-problems-with-quantum-technology}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many businesses would leap at the chance to go back in time to capitalize early on yesterday’s game-changing technologies, such as the internet. The chance to get ahead of the competition is here again with quantum computing. The technology is maturing, and now is the time to build your quantum skills and understand quantum’s immense potential for addressing computationally intensive problems.\n"
msgstr "Maraming negosyo ang gustong bumalik sa nakaraan para mapakinabangan nang maaga ang mga game-changing na teknolohiya noon, tulad ng internet. Narito na naman ang pagkakataon na mauna sa kompetisyon — sa quantum computing. Tumatanda na ang teknolohiya, at ngayon na ang tamang oras para paunlarin ang iyong mga quantum skills at maintindihan ang napakalaking potensyal ng quantum para sa mga computationally intensive na problema.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the era of quantum computing, system performance will be key in achieving full quantum potential and scale—when we can definitively demonstrate, in certain use cases, a significant performance advantage over classical computers. Specifically, when a quantum computation is either hundreds or thousands of times faster, needs a smaller fraction of the memory, or makes something seemingly impossible possible. Our work with UC Berkeley demonstrates the power of currently available IBM Quantum&reg; processors to explore meaningful computations and realistic applications before the era of fault tolerance.\n"
msgstr "Sa panahon ng quantum computing, magiging susi ang performance ng sistema para makamit ang buong quantum potential at scale — kung kailan natin maaaring definitibong ipakita, sa ilang partikular na use case, ang malaking kalamangan sa performance kumpara sa mga classical computer. Partikular, kapag ang isang quantum computation ay daan-daan o libu-libong beses na mas mabilis, nangangailangan ng mas maliit na bahagi ng memorya, o ginagawang posible ang tila imposible. Ang aming trabaho kasama ang UC Berkeley ay nagpapakita ng kapangyarihan ng kasalukuyang available na IBM Quantum&reg; processors para tuklasin ang mga makabuluhang computation at mga realistic na aplikasyon bago pa man ang panahon ng fault tolerance.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computers could soon solve valuable problems that have long challenged classical supercomputers. Governments and industry leaders worldwide are already exploring potential use cases in healthcare, materials science, machine learning, and more. Organizations that dive in now and become quantum ready will have a distinct advantage as these technologies evolve.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring malutas ng mga quantum computer ang mga mahalagang problema na matagal nang hamon sa mga classical supercomputer. Ang mga pamahalaan at mga lider ng industriya sa buong mundo ay nag-eeksplora na ng mga potensyal na use case sa healthcare, materials science, machine learning, at iba pa. Ang mga organisasyong susugal ngayon at magiging quantum ready ay magtataglay ng malinaw na kalamangan habang umuunlad ang mga teknolohiyang ito.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum readiness {#quantum-readiness}"
msgstr "Quantum readiness {#quantum-readiness}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum readiness** is a continuously evolving measure of organizational proficiency in quantum computing strategy, technology and operations. It characterizes the company’s progressive capabilities to leverage quantum technology to disrupt industries, create competitive advantage, and respond to threats from quantum-savvy competitors.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the triangles below to see the capabilities of quantum ready organizations.\n"
msgstr "Ang **quantum readiness** ay isang patuloy na umuusbong na sukatan ng organisasyonal na husay sa quantum computing strategy, teknolohiya, at operasyon. Inilalarawan nito ang progresibong kakayahan ng kumpanya na gamitin ang quantum technology para guluhin ang mga industriya, lumikha ng competitive advantage, at tumugon sa mga banta mula sa mga kakumpitensyang may kaalaman sa quantum.\n"

