# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[The IBM Quantum Network](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/network) is a worldwide collective shaping the future of quantum computing. The 250+ partners in the Network include Fortune 500 companies, universities, laboratories, and startups, all helping to build a quantum economy.\n"
msgstr "[Ang IBM Quantum Network](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/network) ay isang pandaigdigang kolektibo na humuhubog sa kinabukasan ng quantum computing. Ang 250+ na partner sa Network ay kinabibilangan ng mga Fortune 500 na kumpanya, unibersidad, laboratoryo, at startup, na lahat ay tumutulong sa pagbuo ng isang quantum economy.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The mission of the IBM Quantum Network is to:\n"
msgstr "Ang misyon ng IBM Quantum Network ay:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Accelerate research** – Collaborate with leading academic and research organizations to advance quantum computing technology.\n"
msgstr "**Pabilisin ang pananaliksik** – Makipagtulungan sa mga nangungunang akademiko at organisasyon sa pananaliksik para paunlarin ang teknolohiya ng quantum computing.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Educate and prepare** – Expand and train the ecosystem of users, developers, and application specialists that will be essential to the adoption and scaling of quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "**Turuan at ihanda** – Palawakin at sanayin ang ecosystem ng mga gumagamit, developer, at application specialist na magiging mahalaga sa adoption at scaling ng quantum computing.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
