# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Mga pangunahing aral {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can keep these key takeaways in mind:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong tandaan ang mga pangunahing aral na ito:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum technology is maturing every day, and it’s now at an early commercialization tipping point. Quantum has the potential to reinvent the worlds of business, science, education and government in fundamentally new ways. There are steps you can take to prepare for future quantum adoption.\n"
msgstr "Ang quantum technology ay umuunlad araw-araw, at ngayon ay nasa maagang tipping point na ng komersyalisasyon. Ang quantum ay may potensyal na muling lumikha ng mga mundo ng negosyo, agham, edukasyon, at pamahalaan sa pundamental na bagong paraan. May mga hakbang na maaari kang gawin para maghanda para sa hinaharap na quantum adoption.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Safe helps organizations secure their data, systems, and applications with modernized cryptography featuring quantum-resistant algorithms and protocols.\n"
msgstr "Tinutulungan ng IBM Quantum Safe ang mga organisasyon na i-secure ang kanilang data, sistema, at aplikasyon gamit ang modernisadong cryptography na may mga quantum-resistant algorithm at protocol.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Responsible Quantum Computing means developing quantum computing with an awareness of its power and potential impacts.\n"
msgstr "Ang Responsible Quantum Computing ay nangangahulugang pagbuo ng quantum computing na may kamalayan sa kapangyarihan nito at mga potensyal na epekto.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Network is a collaboration of Fortune 500 companies, academic institutions, national labs, and startups working together to advance quantum computing and develop and launch commercial applications.\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Quantum Network ay isang kolaborasyon ng mga Fortune 500 na kumpanya, mga institusyong akademiko, mga pambansang laboratoryo, at mga startup na nagtatrabaho nang magkasama para paunlarin ang quantum computing at bumuo at ilunsad ang mga komersyal na aplikasyon.\n"
